      "content": "thanks for these. i like the vibe for the leader, but the street-smart one feels a bit too much like a movie character or a soldier with the whole holster thing. i was thinking of someone more like an everyday person you'd actually encounter in a gritty city setting. \n\ncan you give me a couple more variations for the street-smart person? maybe one that's a bit younger and one that's a bit more \"urban\" or \"street\" style, so I can see different looks for the character. just make them feel real and authentic to that environment.",
